1
00:00:46,719 --> 00:00:49,759
[Episode 9]

2
00:00:59,029 --> 00:01:03,049
It's okay, Yun. It's nothing, see?

3
00:01:05,719 --> 00:01:08,539
I'm holding your hand.

4
00:01:11,939 --> 00:01:17,309
Don't go anywhere, don't listen to anything,

5
00:01:17,309 --> 00:01:19,689
just hold my hand tight. It's okay.

6
00:01:22,489 --> 00:01:25,629
It's all right. It's nothing.

7
00:01:29,089 --> 00:01:31,069
It's nothing, Yun.

8
00:02:28,699 --> 00:02:30,019
Ma'am.

9
00:03:01,389 --> 00:03:04,789
Because of you, some of us can't eat nor sleep.

10
00:03:04,789 --> 00:03:11,049
I'm not some dog that comes and goes
when you say so, you jerk!

11
00:03:11,049 --> 00:03:12,319
Mister.

12
00:03:14,089 --> 00:03:16,279
What the...

13
00:03:16,279 --> 00:03:18,369
Were you staying with Muhyeok this whole time?

14
00:03:18,369 --> 00:03:20,889
What did I ever do to you to get yelled at?

15
00:03:20,889 --> 00:03:23,009
What's wrong with you?
You're not acting like yourself!

16
00:03:25,499 --> 00:03:28,039
- Where is Choi Yun?
- Is he in surgery?

17
00:03:29,219 --> 00:03:30,869
- What happened?
- Where is he?

18
00:04:10,059 --> 00:04:13,029
Are you all right?

19
00:04:13,029 --> 00:04:14,649
Can you hear me?

20
00:04:39,159 --> 00:04:41,509
- Please, just one comment.
- Just one comment.

21
00:04:46,189 --> 00:04:47,239
Galchi!

22
00:04:49,409 --> 00:04:50,519
Jump!

23
00:04:55,849 --> 00:04:57,459
Isn't it pretty?

24
00:04:57,459 --> 00:04:58,889
Galchi, what do you think?

25
00:04:58,889 --> 00:05:00,629
Very pretty!

26
00:05:07,359 --> 00:05:10,409
Yun! Yun!

27
00:05:13,449 --> 00:05:14,729
It's me.

28
00:05:32,019 --> 00:05:33,249
Sit down!

29
00:06:27,639 --> 00:06:29,089
How did it go, doctor?

30
00:06:29,089 --> 00:06:32,679
His heart may be damaged.

31
00:07:44,189 --> 00:07:49,149
It says "together" in Korean.

32
00:07:49,149 --> 00:07:52,519
We don't know how he got such a necklace.

33
00:07:52,519 --> 00:07:55,799
But we're certain it must be
related to his birth mother.

34
00:08:00,479 --> 00:08:01,939
Muhyeok.

35
00:08:04,189 --> 00:08:05,499
Hey!

36
00:08:05,499 --> 00:08:06,409
Mother!

37
00:08:06,409 --> 00:08:09,009
Who do you think you are?

38
00:08:09,009 --> 00:08:11,649
So-called manager... Where and what were you doing?

39
00:08:11,649 --> 00:08:13,869
How could you let this happen to my baby?

40
00:08:13,869 --> 00:08:18,209
Where were you the whole time?

41
00:08:18,209 --> 00:08:20,509
Where were you, you bastard?

42
00:08:20,509 --> 00:08:24,739
Cut it out. It's not Mr. Cha's fault. Stop it!

43
00:08:24,739 --> 00:08:25,849
Calm down, Mother.

44
00:08:25,849 --> 00:08:28,189
I hate this guy.

45
00:08:28,189 --> 00:08:33,169
If he did his job properly,
this wouldn't have happened to Yun.

46
00:08:33,169 --> 00:08:35,929
It's all this bastard's fault! It's all his fault!

47
00:08:35,929 --> 00:08:38,539
Why are you blaming an innocent person?

48
00:08:38,539 --> 00:08:41,389
You're too emotional right now. Calm down!

49
00:08:41,389 --> 00:08:45,579
Sorry, Mr. Cha. Please be understanding.

50
00:08:45,579 --> 00:08:50,759
If something happens to Yun, I won't forgive you!

51
00:08:50,759 --> 00:08:53,009
I won't forgive you!

52
00:08:53,009 --> 00:08:55,759
- Come inside!
- You won't get away with this!

53
00:09:00,319 --> 00:09:05,289
I'm sorry. I'll apologize on her behalf.

54
00:09:43,129 --> 00:09:50,809
Son! Yun! Mom is here.

55
00:09:50,809 --> 00:09:57,679
Sorry, Yun. For coming late...

56
00:09:59,659 --> 00:10:02,949
Yun. Yun!

57
00:10:02,949 --> 00:10:07,669
I'm sorry for coming so late.

58
00:10:07,669 --> 00:10:11,659
What am I going to do?

59
00:10:18,799 --> 00:10:23,909
Yun!

60
00:10:27,849 --> 00:10:29,439
Yun!

61
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:34,239
Yun!

62
00:10:47,519 --> 00:10:49,779
Hello. How are you?

63
00:10:49,779 --> 00:10:51,189
The results.

64
00:10:53,659 --> 00:10:59,799
Ligaments in his right ankle and knee were damaged.

65
00:10:59,799 --> 00:11:02,939
Fortunately, only one leg is damaged.

66
00:11:02,939 --> 00:11:06,839
Once the cast is off, he'll have no problem walking.

67
00:11:07,969 --> 00:11:10,689
The problem is his heart.

68
00:11:10,689 --> 00:11:12,119
His heart?

69
00:11:12,119 --> 00:11:16,689
According to his records,
Yun genetically has a very weak heart.

70
00:11:16,689 --> 00:11:20,969
During the operation, an issue with his heart arose,

71
00:11:20,969 --> 00:11:23,919
which extended the surgery.

72
00:11:23,919 --> 00:11:26,849
We have to wait for further test results but

73
00:11:26,849 --> 00:11:31,349
I think his chest hit the handle hard in the accident.

74
00:11:31,349 --> 00:11:35,429
His heart may have developed a serious problem.

75
00:11:36,489 --> 00:11:41,929
We need to stabilize him and monitor his progress.

76
00:12:36,619 --> 00:12:41,039
Yun, Yun, are you awake?

77
00:12:41,039 --> 00:12:44,229
Yun, are you awake?

78
00:12:44,229 --> 00:12:45,369
Mom!

79
00:12:46,339 --> 00:12:51,039
Yes, Mom is here! Mom is right here!

80
00:12:51,039 --> 00:12:52,539
Eunchae!

81
00:12:52,539 --> 00:12:53,799
What?

82
00:12:56,009 --> 00:12:59,149
Where is Eunchae?

83
00:12:59,149 --> 00:13:05,169
Eunchae is doing fine. It's fine.

84
00:13:16,799 --> 00:13:18,729
Will you bring Eunchae?

85
00:13:19,869 --> 00:13:23,839
Yun is looking for Eunchae. Please bring her.

86
00:13:29,189 --> 00:13:30,659
Wait.

87
00:13:31,599 --> 00:13:37,049
Have we met somewhere before?

88
00:13:57,399 --> 00:14:02,029
I think his chest hit the handle hard in the accident.

89
00:14:02,029 --> 00:14:06,019
His heart may have developed a serious problem.

90
00:14:18,389 --> 00:14:25,149
I'm so furious...
That awful brat will put me in an early grave.

91
00:14:25,149 --> 00:14:26,639
I know...

92
00:14:28,439 --> 00:14:34,689
She hasn't slept or had a drop of water.
Does she want to live or die?

93
00:14:34,689 --> 00:14:37,699
Even Yun's mom is eating something!

94
00:14:37,699 --> 00:14:39,409
I know...

95
00:14:39,409 --> 00:14:41,909
Is Yun your husband or something?

96
00:14:41,909 --> 00:14:43,789
Are you gonna die if he does?

97
00:14:43,789 --> 00:14:45,239
That's what I'm saying!

98
00:14:46,179 --> 00:14:49,939
Fine. You grab her arms, you open her mouth!

99
00:14:49,939 --> 00:14:51,989
Let's force feed her.

100
00:14:51,989 --> 00:14:54,719
I won't have my child die over some guy.

101
00:14:54,719 --> 00:14:57,899
Wait, wait. Just leave her be.
We can't force her to eat.

102
00:14:57,899 --> 00:14:59,539
Yeah.

103
00:15:07,839 --> 00:15:10,409
Who are you?

104
00:15:10,409 --> 00:15:12,939
It's Yun's manager.

105
00:15:13,829 --> 00:15:16,579
Where is Eunchae?

106
00:15:20,079 --> 00:15:21,709
Where is she?

107
00:15:32,019 --> 00:15:37,419
Eunchae. The sleaz... Yun's manager is here.

108
00:15:44,419 --> 00:15:48,659
Eunchae hasn't drank any water,
hasn't had any sleep

109
00:15:48,659 --> 00:15:52,169
and is almost showing symptoms of autism.

110
00:15:52,169 --> 00:15:55,229
She's in a fragile state,
so don't talk too loudly.

111
00:15:55,229 --> 00:15:58,589
And don't make her feel uneasy. Be careful.

112
00:16:19,059 --> 00:16:22,549
Yun is awake.

113
00:16:26,059 --> 00:16:27,649
He's awake?

114
00:16:30,909 --> 00:16:33,759
Yun is alive?

115
00:16:35,229 --> 00:16:37,189
He's looking for you.

116
00:16:44,959 --> 00:16:48,289
Let's go. They want me to bring you.

117
00:17:00,049 --> 00:17:01,879
Blockhead!

118
00:18:17,739 --> 00:18:20,609
Yun's gonna die while waiting for you.

119
00:18:20,609 --> 00:18:21,819
Let's go!

120
00:18:27,349 --> 00:18:33,159
Mister! Put me down! Put me down!

121
00:18:33,159 --> 00:18:35,289
Put me down, Mister!

122
00:18:35,289 --> 00:18:38,929
- Eunchae.
- Mom!

123
00:18:39,909 --> 00:18:42,309
Mister!

124
00:18:43,429 --> 00:18:44,429
Leave them alone, Mom.

125
00:18:44,429 --> 00:18:47,369
She's gotta go, even if it's like that.
Or else she might rot and die in that room.

126
00:18:47,369 --> 00:18:50,879
- But still...
- He's so hot...

127
00:18:50,879 --> 00:18:52,779
No, no!

128
00:18:53,339 --> 00:18:57,029
What are you doing?

129
00:18:57,029 --> 00:19:00,819
Put me down!

130
00:19:00,819 --> 00:19:02,889
Put me down!

131
00:19:02,889 --> 00:19:08,179
Put me down! What are you doing?

132
00:19:08,179 --> 00:19:11,589
Put me down!

133
00:19:19,719 --> 00:19:20,809
Mister!

134
00:19:27,359 --> 00:19:29,319
What do you think you're doing?

135
00:19:29,319 --> 00:19:31,729
I won't go! I said I'm not going!

136
00:19:31,729 --> 00:19:33,739
I won't go!

137
00:19:44,729 --> 00:19:49,289
Don't be angry. Don't yell.

138
00:19:49,289 --> 00:19:55,359
I heard you didn't sleep and didn't drink.
Save your energy.

139
00:19:55,359 --> 00:20:00,239
I'm not going to Yun. Do you hear me?

140
00:20:13,469 --> 00:20:15,979
Listen up.

141
00:20:17,409 --> 00:20:19,699
I'm not going to Yun.

142
00:20:20,669 --> 00:20:22,479
I can't go...

143
00:20:23,649 --> 00:20:26,809
Not after what I did to him.

144
00:20:28,309 --> 00:20:31,289
I was so cruel to him.

145
00:20:31,289 --> 00:20:34,029
How can I look him in the eyes?

146
00:20:36,389 --> 00:20:41,759
That's a lot of tears for someone
who didn't drink any water.

147
00:20:43,389 --> 00:20:45,399
Are you a kid?

148
00:20:46,349 --> 00:20:50,279
You're going to flood the place. Stop crying!

149
00:20:53,029 --> 00:20:58,049
If you keep crying, I'll just keep you, forever!

150
00:21:00,579 --> 00:21:04,779
Let's eat. Let's eat something.

151
00:21:04,779 --> 00:21:06,759
Stop the car.

152
00:21:06,759 --> 00:21:09,239
Would you rather eat or kiss me?

153
00:21:09,239 --> 00:21:10,789
Stop the car, now!

154
00:21:10,789 --> 00:21:13,109
Would you rather eat or sleep with me?

155
00:21:13,109 --> 00:21:14,719
I'm going to open the door and jump out!

156
00:21:14,719 --> 00:21:17,649
Would you rather eat? Or just live with me?

157
00:21:17,649 --> 00:21:20,778
Would you rather eat?
Or would you rather...

158
00:21:20,778 --> 00:21:22,739
die with me?

159
00:22:22,479 --> 00:22:25,199
[Let's eet]

160
00:22:33,349 --> 00:22:35,779
Don't play with your food!

161
00:24:31,289 --> 00:24:35,079
- Let's go.
- I don't want to go.

162
00:24:35,079 --> 00:24:39,729
I want to stay here. I just want to stay next to Yun.

163
00:24:39,729 --> 00:24:43,389
It's not going to be over in one or two days.

164
00:24:43,389 --> 00:24:47,579
Go home, sleep, and pull yourself together.

165
00:24:47,579 --> 00:24:51,759
Minju will look after him. Let's go.

166
00:24:51,759 --> 00:24:54,649
But I should be there.

167
00:24:54,649 --> 00:24:57,149
He needs his mom...

168
00:24:57,929 --> 00:25:01,729
Yun... Son...

169
00:25:02,509 --> 00:25:07,529
A mother needs to be by her child!

170
00:25:08,289 --> 00:25:11,109
I have to be here for him.

171
00:25:15,589 --> 00:25:17,069
Muhyeok!

172
00:25:17,729 --> 00:25:20,389
Muhyeok! Muhyeok!

173
00:25:21,739 --> 00:25:26,169
Muhyeok!

174
00:25:26,719 --> 00:25:28,309
Muhyeok!

175
00:25:35,329 --> 00:25:36,679
Muhyeok!

176
00:25:38,559 --> 00:25:43,159
Who do you think you are?

177
00:25:43,159 --> 00:25:44,999
Where and what were you doing?

178
00:25:44,999 --> 00:25:48,069
If he did his job properly,
this wouldn't have happened to Yun.

179
00:25:48,069 --> 00:25:51,829
It's all this bastard's fault! It's all his fault!

180
00:25:51,829 --> 00:25:55,479
If something happens to Yun, I won't forgive you!

181
00:25:55,479 --> 00:25:59,249
- Come inside!
- You won't get away with this!

182
00:28:15,709 --> 00:28:17,549
What room is Choi Yun in?

183
00:28:17,549 --> 00:28:19,649
Just a moment.

184
00:28:19,649 --> 00:28:21,899
You'll have to go to Internal Medicine.

185
00:28:22,799 --> 00:28:23,799
Okay.

186
00:28:51,759 --> 00:28:52,959
Come in.

187
00:29:05,539 --> 00:29:08,009
What took you so long?

188
00:29:08,009 --> 00:29:11,609
Yun was waiting up for you all night.

189
00:29:16,089 --> 00:29:17,919
I should get going.

190
00:29:21,169 --> 00:29:25,379
Hold on. I'm just gonna say hello.

191
00:29:25,379 --> 00:29:28,589
You should stay with Yun.

192
00:29:28,589 --> 00:29:31,179
Yun's like this because of me.

193
00:29:31,889 --> 00:29:33,669
What do you mean?

194
00:29:35,269 --> 00:29:38,979
I met someone else.

195
00:29:42,659 --> 00:29:44,789
It just happened...

196
00:29:48,149 --> 00:29:53,429
What... What did you do to Yun?

197
00:29:53,429 --> 00:29:58,439
I'm not sure myself.

198
00:29:58,439 --> 00:30:00,149
Kang Minju!

199
00:30:00,149 --> 00:30:02,099
I really don't know.

200
00:30:03,579 --> 00:30:10,319
I'm really not sure how we got into this mess.

201
00:30:21,569 --> 00:30:22,779
Get out.

202
00:30:27,729 --> 00:30:29,539
Get lost!

203
00:30:52,759 --> 00:30:54,819
I'm sorry, Yun.

204
00:30:57,189 --> 00:31:00,199
I had no idea what you were going through.

205
00:31:01,119 --> 00:31:09,389
I didn't know it was bad enough for you to want to die.

206
00:32:17,749 --> 00:32:21,109
Open the door. Please!

207
00:32:21,109 --> 00:32:23,699
Minju! Open the door!

208
00:32:25,449 --> 00:32:29,279
Kang Minju. Who's that guy next to you?

209
00:32:31,039 --> 00:32:33,129
Who's that bastard next to you?

210
00:32:52,019 --> 00:32:53,979
Do you wanna sleep with me?

211
00:32:55,049 --> 00:32:59,029
If you get involved with me,
it'd be till death do us part.

212
00:33:02,389 --> 00:33:04,089
I love you.

213
00:33:05,519 --> 00:33:09,259
It just happened that way. I love you.

214
00:34:35,659 --> 00:34:41,649
To some, love is as easy to spit out
as chewing gum.

215
00:34:42,819 --> 00:34:48,789
But others will put their life on the line
for that person.

216
00:34:56,489 --> 00:34:59,179
Think of it as being punished for your sins, lady.

217
00:35:14,199 --> 00:35:17,089
This is #2204.

218
00:35:17,089 --> 00:35:19,979
I'd like to rent out my apartment.
[Bank accounts: Kim Galchi / Yun Seo-kyeong]

219
00:35:26,639 --> 00:35:28,019
Mr. Song.

220
00:35:33,989 --> 00:35:37,319
He wouldn't take our Yun as well right?

221
00:35:40,629 --> 00:35:44,469
Yun's all I've got.

222
00:35:44,469 --> 00:35:47,939
He's my everything.

223
00:35:47,939 --> 00:35:51,719
He wouldn't take him from me right?

224
00:35:53,059 --> 00:35:55,979
Of course not.

225
00:35:58,169 --> 00:36:03,179
If he was alive, he would be 27 years old by now.

226
00:36:05,579 --> 00:36:10,289
That child who died unable to see the light of day

227
00:36:10,289 --> 00:36:13,209
would be 27 by now.

228
00:36:16,639 --> 00:36:20,489
I was counting the days without knowing.

229
00:36:21,349 --> 00:36:27,389
If he hadn't died, today would be his birthday.

230
00:36:37,089 --> 00:36:40,199
- 24.
- 24.

231
00:36:41,429 --> 00:36:43,869
25.

232
00:36:44,949 --> 00:36:49,359
- 26.
- Six.

233
00:36:49,359 --> 00:36:51,799
27.

234
00:36:53,479 --> 00:36:59,509
Wait. Since you and Uncle are twins,
it's his birthday, too.

235
00:36:59,509 --> 00:37:01,579
- Mom, let's call Uncle.
- OKay.

236
00:37:03,289 --> 00:37:04,739
And Eunchae.

237
00:37:04,739 --> 00:37:06,629
Let's call Eunchae, too.

238
00:37:23,729 --> 00:37:25,539
Uncle!

239
00:37:26,959 --> 00:37:30,819
Hurry up!

240
00:37:41,959 --> 00:37:44,159
We even got a cake!

241
00:37:44,159 --> 00:37:47,069
We got a delicious cake!

242
00:37:53,129 --> 00:37:59,209
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

243
00:37:59,209 --> 00:38:04,009
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

244
00:38:04,009 --> 00:38:07,069
♪ Happy birthday, dear Mom and Uncle ♪

245
00:38:18,179 --> 00:38:19,859
Hey, you!

246
00:38:21,319 --> 00:38:24,219
- And Mom!
- No!

247
00:38:24,219 --> 00:38:26,499
Hold her!

248
00:38:40,819 --> 00:38:43,619
27 years ago,

249
00:38:43,619 --> 00:38:49,769
a young actress fell in love with
a married man, some director.

250
00:38:49,769 --> 00:38:53,569
She gave birth to twins.

251
00:38:57,729 --> 00:38:59,189
I'll get going.

252
00:39:03,549 --> 00:39:08,499
But the twins were given to an orphanage.

253
00:39:08,499 --> 00:39:11,549
Maybe because they were afraid of the scandal.

254
00:39:11,549 --> 00:39:16,019
Who cared what happened to the kids?
She had to make a living.

255
00:39:17,779 --> 00:39:23,429
So one of them got adopted by an Australian couple.

256
00:39:23,429 --> 00:39:27,639
But soon got abandoned by that family

257
00:39:27,639 --> 00:39:31,079
and lived like a dog on the streets.

258
00:39:31,079 --> 00:39:36,779
The other went looking for her mom
when she was five, got hit by a car

259
00:39:36,779 --> 00:39:40,589
and became mentally disabled.
She remained a child, mentally.

260
00:39:40,589 --> 00:39:45,399
Now, she lives with a fatherless son.

261
00:39:46,519 --> 00:39:51,039
Truth will prevail in the end.

262
00:39:51,039 --> 00:39:54,059
The ancient scholars were so wise...

263
00:39:54,059 --> 00:39:57,459
How did they create such words of wisdom?

264
00:40:00,659 --> 00:40:02,339
Who are you?

265
00:40:04,409 --> 00:40:06,649
You've grown old as well.

266
00:40:07,639 --> 00:40:11,149
27 years ago, I was a young reporter.

267
00:40:11,149 --> 00:40:14,379
I saw you in front of the orphanage with the twins.

268
00:40:15,589 --> 00:40:18,329
You can't fool the hands of time.

269
00:40:30,969 --> 00:40:34,299
Oh, yeah. I asked Eunchae to come.

270
00:40:34,299 --> 00:40:36,419
Oh, yeah. We asked her to come.

271
00:40:37,859 --> 00:40:40,929
- But she didn't pick up.
- Nope!

272
00:40:40,929 --> 00:40:43,949
- I want to see Eunchae.
- Me, too.

273
00:40:44,549 --> 00:40:46,549
Where is Eunchae?

274
00:40:48,689 --> 00:40:50,009
Where is she?

275
00:41:16,409 --> 00:41:21,119
That child who died unable to see the light of day

276
00:41:21,119 --> 00:41:23,929
would be 27 by now.

277
00:41:23,929 --> 00:41:26,489
Do you know that guy?

278
00:41:26,489 --> 00:41:29,269
Yes. He's like a brother to me.

279
00:41:31,599 --> 00:41:35,239
Truth will prevail in the end.

280
00:41:36,179 --> 00:41:41,839
The two kissed without taking a breath, then fainted.

281
00:41:41,839 --> 00:41:44,719
Hey! Eunchae!

282
00:41:49,159 --> 00:41:52,959
Mom, I can't believe this!

283
00:41:52,959 --> 00:41:56,299
Yun wouldn't let go of Eunchae's hand.

284
00:41:57,069 --> 00:41:58,719
I'm serious!

285
00:41:58,719 --> 00:42:01,819
Eunchae can't even go to the bathroom!

286
00:42:02,739 --> 00:42:06,429
That punk holds her hand even when he's asleep!

287
00:42:06,429 --> 00:42:10,759
I'm serious!

288
00:42:10,759 --> 00:42:13,129
She wants you on the phone
because she thinks I'm lying.

289
00:42:14,269 --> 00:42:17,049
What mom doesn't believe her daughter?

290
00:42:17,049 --> 00:42:20,249
Yeah, Mom. Sukchae's telling the truth.

291
00:42:20,249 --> 00:42:26,659
Even the nurses are amazed.
Yun won't let go of Eunchae's hand!

292
00:42:26,659 --> 00:42:31,979
When she tries to move away,
his heart rate spikes, so she can't.

293
00:42:33,159 --> 00:42:34,999
There is a medical term for this psychological state.

294
00:42:34,999 --> 00:42:37,119
The nurse said it was... something...

295
00:42:37,119 --> 00:42:41,779
Of course not! She can't eat!
She can barely go to the bathroom.

296
00:42:44,809 --> 00:42:46,249
What are you doing?

297
00:44:45,609 --> 00:44:46,839
Eunchae!

298
00:44:56,329 --> 00:45:00,049
What's wrong? Are you in pain?

299
00:45:01,119 --> 00:45:03,289
- Are you okay?
- It doesn't hurt.

300
00:45:10,819 --> 00:45:14,449
Minchae! Choi Yun is in the papers again.

301
00:45:17,029 --> 00:45:20,969
[Choi Yun Overcoming His Car Accident Through Singing!]

302
00:45:21,869 --> 00:45:23,909
Thanks to all your concerns,

303
00:45:23,909 --> 00:45:25,709
my injuries are healing

304
00:45:25,709 --> 00:45:27,589
and my wounds are improving.

305
00:45:27,589 --> 00:45:31,379
You shouldn't be doing this right now.
I hope you're okay.

306
00:45:31,379 --> 00:45:33,759
Are you okay, Yun?

307
00:45:33,759 --> 00:45:36,269
I don't have to worry, right, son?

308
00:46:23,709 --> 00:46:27,789
Where is he? He's not answering my calls.

309
00:46:27,789 --> 00:46:28,919
Is he sleeping?

310
00:46:28,919 --> 00:46:31,169
Yun. I'll be right back.
I'm going to get something from the car.

311
00:46:31,169 --> 00:46:33,929
- Eunchae!
- Yeah?

312
00:46:34,939 --> 00:46:37,399
There's somewhere you and I have to go to together.

313
00:46:48,749 --> 00:46:53,019
Isn't it pretty? Isn't it just like you?

314
00:46:53,019 --> 00:46:55,069
What is this?

315
00:46:55,069 --> 00:46:57,649
It's your car now.

316
00:46:57,649 --> 00:46:58,609
Huh?

317
00:46:59,229 --> 00:47:00,843
- Pay for it with this.
- Yes, sir.

318
00:47:01,043 --> 00:47:02,814
- Yun!
- Full payment, please.

319
00:47:02,814 --> 00:47:04,309
Yes, sir. Thank you.

320
00:47:04,309 --> 00:47:07,275
Wait! We're not buying this.

321
00:47:07,275 --> 00:47:09,249
- Please proceed.
- Yes, sir.

322
00:47:09,249 --> 00:47:11,349
Will you drive me around till I get better?

323
00:47:11,349 --> 00:47:15,149
You know that my license is suspended
and I can't drive.

324
00:47:15,149 --> 00:47:19,659
But still. I can't accept this, Yun.

325
00:47:19,659 --> 00:47:24,879
It's always been heartbreaking to
see you struggle as you carried

326
00:47:24,879 --> 00:47:29,709
all the clothes and equipment.

327
00:47:29,709 --> 00:47:35,309
I'm okay. I'm strong. You know that.

328
00:47:35,309 --> 00:47:38,539
And I need to get tougher anyways.

329
00:47:38,539 --> 00:47:42,119
What's with you?
I've been your coordinator for long enough.

330
00:47:42,119 --> 00:47:45,089
You never said anything before.
Why are you doing this now?

331
00:47:46,109 --> 00:47:52,549
I was too wrapped up in that girl
to see what was in front of me.

332
00:47:52,549 --> 00:47:55,279
She blinded me,

333
00:47:55,279 --> 00:47:58,359
so I couldn't see what was happening.

334
00:47:58,359 --> 00:48:02,639
I couldn't see how hard things were for you.

335
00:48:05,169 --> 00:48:07,119
I'm sorry it took me so long.

336
00:48:10,479 --> 00:48:12,719
Can we drive it out of here?

337
00:48:31,030 --> 00:48:32,599
[5 missed calls from Song Eunchae]

338
00:48:45,199 --> 00:48:49,879
I know your evil plan! You act all nice

339
00:48:49,879 --> 00:48:52,819
but actually you're planning
to give me double the work, right?

340
00:48:52,819 --> 00:48:56,029
Not only the coordinator but now I'm your driver, too?

341
00:48:56,029 --> 00:48:59,989
You've only become more devious since the accident.

342
00:49:01,769 --> 00:49:04,979
Fine, I'll take it, I suppose.

343
00:49:04,979 --> 00:49:08,349
I've devoted so much time to you.

344
00:49:08,349 --> 00:49:10,419
That's worth at least this.

345
00:49:11,729 --> 00:49:14,079
You're dead meat if you try to take it back.

346
00:49:16,669 --> 00:49:18,799
Stop. What are you doing?

347
00:49:19,569 --> 00:49:21,419
Your hand saved me.

348
00:49:22,329 --> 00:49:24,919
During the accident...

349
00:49:24,919 --> 00:49:34,029
I was thinking, "So this is how I die.
I guess this is the end."

350
00:49:34,029 --> 00:49:36,439
Then suddenly, I heard your voice.

351
00:49:38,249 --> 00:49:43,089
"It's okay, Yun. It's going to be okay.

352
00:49:44,409 --> 00:49:50,579
Don't go anywhere. Don't listen to anything.

353
00:49:52,409 --> 00:49:54,699
Just hold my hand tight.

354
00:49:56,089 --> 00:50:00,769
It's okay, Yun. It's nothing."

355
00:50:01,789 --> 00:50:06,759
I'm never going to let go ever again.

356
00:50:11,689 --> 00:50:14,109
Keep driving. I'll answer it.

357
00:50:17,229 --> 00:50:18,779
It's Muhyeok.

358
00:50:19,539 --> 00:50:20,959
Yeah, Muhyeok.

359
00:50:22,359 --> 00:50:24,749
Eunchae is with me.

360
00:50:26,789 --> 00:50:29,319
You can go home.

361
00:50:29,319 --> 00:50:34,289
I cancelled everything today
so I can go on a date with Eunchae.

362
00:50:36,499 --> 00:50:38,589
I'm...

363
00:50:40,102 --> 00:50:42,079
I'm dating Eunchae.

364
00:51:04,789 --> 00:51:06,759
Surprised, my Eunchae?

365
00:51:06,759 --> 00:51:07,689
Yun.

366
00:51:07,689 --> 00:51:11,269
Don't question the past.
Just forgive everything I've done.

367
00:51:13,399 --> 00:51:16,899
I didn't know much back then.

368
00:51:16,899 --> 00:51:22,839
Without you, I was like a lost child.

369
00:51:22,839 --> 00:51:26,799
When you ate something and really enjoyed it,

370
00:51:26,799 --> 00:51:29,659
I felt better than if I had eaten it myself.

371
00:51:31,499 --> 00:51:34,529
How was I supposed to know that was love?

372
00:51:35,219 --> 00:51:36,509
Yun.

373
00:51:37,819 --> 00:51:39,829
I love you, Eunchae.

374
00:51:43,669 --> 00:51:48,049
I'm sorry for realizing it so late.

375
00:51:56,119 --> 00:51:57,849
I have to call my dad.

376
00:51:59,329 --> 00:52:03,259
Wait for a bit.
I'm going to ask him to drive you home.

377
00:52:03,259 --> 00:52:04,229
Hey!

378
00:52:05,169 --> 00:52:06,549
Eunchae!

379
00:52:10,549 --> 00:52:11,789
Eunchae!

380
00:52:35,799 --> 00:52:38,879
You sold the condo and moved here?

381
00:52:41,019 --> 00:52:46,099
I've been thinking hard, Mr. Kang.

382
00:52:46,099 --> 00:52:51,169
Or should I say, Cha Muhyeok?

383
00:52:51,169 --> 00:52:54,279
I just don't get you.

384
00:52:54,279 --> 00:52:56,709
Who are you, really?

385
00:53:00,269 --> 00:53:02,249
Does it have something to do with Yun?

386
00:53:04,559 --> 00:53:07,329
Do you have a grudge against Yun?

387
00:53:11,429 --> 00:53:14,859
Because of you, I lost Yun and Eunchae,

388
00:53:14,859 --> 00:53:18,879
the only people in my life who really loved me...

389
00:53:30,579 --> 00:53:32,949
Sorry.

390
00:53:32,949 --> 00:53:34,909
I'm sorry.

391
00:53:36,939 --> 00:53:39,019
I could just tell Yun.

392
00:53:41,219 --> 00:53:44,119
I could tell him everything.

393
00:53:51,019 --> 00:53:53,039
Do whatever you want.

394
00:53:54,479 --> 00:54:01,909
Tell Yun that you got seduced
by his bastard manager.

395
00:54:06,239 --> 00:54:15,239
Should I also tell him that I'm
still being seduced by that bastard?

396
00:54:27,469 --> 00:54:32,609
Without you, I was like a lost child.

397
00:54:32,609 --> 00:54:36,389
When you ate something and really enjoyed it,

398
00:54:36,389 --> 00:54:39,249
I felt better than if I had eaten it myself.

399
00:54:39,249 --> 00:54:41,979
How was I supposed to know that was love?

400
00:54:45,639 --> 00:54:48,319
- Do you like me too?
- No!

401
00:54:48,319 --> 00:54:50,599
Then why poke a man minding his own business?

402
00:54:52,439 --> 00:54:55,709
Even if I, the girl of your dreams,

403
00:54:55,709 --> 00:54:58,939
gets a little hurt, keep your cool.

404
00:55:03,999 --> 00:55:05,569
Give me...

405
00:55:07,149 --> 00:55:08,829
Give me a hug.

406
00:55:08,829 --> 00:55:14,919
Like with Yun. Just one hug.

407
00:55:20,609 --> 00:55:22,309
Don't go, Eunchae.

408
00:55:23,639 --> 00:55:26,338
I won't burden you.

409
00:55:27,868 --> 00:55:29,379
Don't go.

410
00:55:31,859 --> 00:55:34,449
Yun is alive?

411
00:55:36,109 --> 00:55:37,899
He's looking for you.

412
00:55:37,899 --> 00:55:39,499
Put me down!

413
00:55:39,499 --> 00:55:43,239
Put me down!

414
00:55:43,699 --> 00:55:45,559
Put me down!

415
00:55:45,559 --> 00:55:47,979
Would you rather eat or kiss me?

416
00:55:47,979 --> 00:55:50,069
Would you rather eat or sleep with me?

417
00:55:50,069 --> 00:55:51,739
I'm going to open the door and jump out!

418
00:55:51,739 --> 00:55:54,019
Would you rather eat? Or just live with me?

419
00:55:55,019 --> 00:55:58,359
Would you rather eat? Or would you rather...

420
00:55:58,359 --> 00:55:59,739
die with me?

421
00:56:03,999 --> 00:56:10,309
Could you take care of my sister and Galchi?

422
00:57:22,169 --> 00:57:23,369
Mister!

423
00:57:26,209 --> 00:57:27,679
Mister...

424
00:57:42,004 --> 00:57:43,446
[Episode 10 Preview]

425
00:57:43,446 --> 00:57:46,660
The increasingly painful headaches, the nosebleeds...

426
00:57:46,660 --> 00:57:52,284
Do those mean I haven't got much time left?

427
00:57:56,053 --> 00:57:58,785
[Sorry, I now await a beautiful death]

428
00:57:58,785 --> 00:58:00,120
Was it a hard life?

429
00:58:00,120 --> 00:58:02,288
No, because I knew I'd be back here some day

430
00:58:02,288 --> 00:58:04,457
to find my birth mother who was
too poor to raise her child

431
00:58:04,457 --> 00:58:05,719
and wanted to buy her a house.

432
00:58:05,719 --> 00:58:08,935
Because I had hope, it wasn't hard at all.

433
00:58:08,935 --> 00:58:11,648
[Love, I can no longer stop]

434
00:58:11,648 --> 00:58:15,845
I can't forget Muhyeok.

435
00:58:15,845 --> 00:58:20,479
I worry so much that Muhyeok might be

436
00:58:20,479 --> 00:58:24,632
sad and lonely because of me.
